    ram: "2GB+"
    benchmarks:
      - device: reComputer J401
        value: 48
        unit: FPS
      - device: reComputer RK3588
        value: 35
        unit: FPS
      - device: reComputer R01
        value: 28
        unit: FPS
    wiki: |
      YOLO11 small 版本，在精度与速度之间取得平衡，适合多数边缘场景。

  - id: yolo11m
    name: yolo11m
    slug: yolo11m
    overview: YOLO11 medium，更高精度。
