    ram: "2GB+"
    benchmarks:
      - device: reComputer J401
        value: 38
        unit: FPS
      - device: reComputer RK3588
        value: 28
        unit: FPS
      - device: reComputer R01
        value: 22
        unit: FPS
    wiki: |
      YOLO11 medium 版本，更高精度，适合对检测质量要求较高的场景。

